# Shelfmark — Library Management System

React + TypeScript frontend · Node + TypeScript API · PostgreSQL (PGlite locally).

## Backend structure

```text
backend/
├── server.ts                 # entry point
├── .env
└── src/
    ├── app.ts
    ├── config/
    ├── db/
    ├── sql/
    ├── routes/
    ├── controllers/
    ├── services/
    ├── middleware/
    ├── types/
    └── utils/
```

## Run

### Backend (port 5000)
```bash
cd backend
npm install
npm run dev
```

### Frontend (port 3000)
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```

Vite proxies `/api` → `http://localhost:5000`.

### Seed logins
| Role   | Email                   | Password  |
|--------|-------------------------|-----------|
| Member | priya@shelfmark.local   | member123 |
| Admin  | admin@shelfmark.local   | admin123  |

## Database

- Default: embedded **PGlite** in `backend/data/`
- Real Postgres: set `DATABASE_URL` in `backend/.env`

